{"id":77,"name":"ponyta","speciesId":77,"dex":77,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["fire"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":85,"defense":55,"special-attack":65,"special-defense":65,"speed":90},"abilities":[{"name":"run-away","hidden":false},{"name":"flash-fire","hidden":false},{"name":"flame-body","hidden":true}],"height":10,"weight":300,"baseExp":82,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/77.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/77.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/77.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/77.ogg","genus":"Fire Horse Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Cavalo de Fogo","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Its hooves are 10 times harder than diamonds. It can trample anything completely flat in little time."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Capable of jumping incredibly high. Its hooves and sturdy legs absorb the impact of a hard landing."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is a weak run­ ner immediately after birth. It gradually becomes faster by chasing after its parents."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its hind legs, which have hard­ er-than-diamond hooves, kick back at any presence it senses behind it."},{"version":"crystal","text":"Training by jumping over grass that grows longer every day has made it a world-class jumper."},{"version":"ruby","text":"PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. This POKéMON becomes stronger by stumbling and falling to keep up with its parent."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. Its legs become stronger as it stumbles and falls while trying to keep up with its parent."},{"version":"firered","text":"Its body is light, and its legs are incredibly powerful. It can clear Ayers Rock in one leap."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Its hooves are ten times harder than diamond. It can trample anything completely flat in little time."},{"version":"diamond","text":"About an hour after birth, its fiery mane and tail grow out, giving it an impressive appearance."},{"version":"pearl","text":"Its legs grow strong while it chases after its parent. It runs in fields and mountains all day."},{"version":"platinum","text":"As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It is a weak runner immediately after birth. It gradually becomes faster by chasing after its parents."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Its hind legs, which have hooves that are harder than diamond, kick back at any presence it senses behind it."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ponyta is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. This Pokémon becomes stronger by stumbling and falling to keep up with its parent."},{"version":"sword","text":"It can’t run properly when it’s newly born. As it races around with others of its kind, its legs grow stronger."},{"version":"shield","text":"If you’ve been accepted by Ponyta, its burning mane is mysteriously no longer hot to the touch."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"These Pokémon live in herds out in the grassland. Newborn foals lack their fiery manes, which will develop about an hour after birth."}],"flavorPt":"Esses Pokémon vivem em rebanhos nas pastagens. Os potros recém-nascidos não têm crinas ígneas, que se desenvolverão cerca de uma hora após o nascimento.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":190,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"ponyta","speciesId":77,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 40","Nível 40"],"species":"rapidash","speciesId":78,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":77,"name":"ponyta","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/77.png"},{"id":10162,"name":"ponyta-galar","form"